  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell to hardcoded IP with canarytokens.com beacon",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that spawns an interactive bash with stdio redirected to a TCP socket at 147.93.157.202:8080, granting interactive command execution on the installer's host at `npm install` time. Shell output is additionally piped via `curl -X POST --data-binary @-` to a canarytokens.com tracking URL, producing an out-of-band beacon that also forwards bytes read from the reverse-shell socket. The channel fires automatically on default install, requires no user action, and is directed to hardcoded non-first-party destinations.",
